==Creation==

The full creation process requires an untradeable ingredient, [[Snake weed]], which can only be found by searching [[Marshy jungle vine|marshy jungle vines]] south-west of [[Tai Bwo Wannai]] or as a drop from [[Jogre|Jogres]] and [[Tribesman|Tribesmen]]. Each step of the process must be done manually and one at a time, there is no make-x menu. The prescription goggles will save a secondary ingredient, but the reagent pouch will not hold them.

